{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, Then move and grab it, in order to process it, Or avoid obstacles and scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleInPath    />",
